[gd_scene load_steps=8 format=3 uid="uid://b3xragent01vc"]

; Geometric agent embodiment (PRD-023 WP-9 M3, ADR-130 Decision 4, copresence
; brief §1). Minimal legible form — a crystal orb core, an explicit gaze cone,
; and a screen-facing DID badge — NOT a humanoid skeleton. State is shown by
; colour/emission and motion, driven from the Rust AgentAvatarNode via
; agent_avatar.gd. Body/face tracking are out of scope (Quest 3 lacks the
; hardware) and never appear here.

